OL,3,ASupermarket freezers in Belgium, Sweden
OL,4,Aand Luxembourg hit by suspected
OL,5,Acyber-attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of supermarkets in Belgium and
OL,8,FSweden have been hit by a suspected
OL,9,Fcyber-attack affecting its
OL,10,Frefrigerators and freezers.
OL,12,FAround 40 Delhaize supermarkets in
OL,13,FBelgium and Luxembourg were affected,
OL,14,Fwhile several ICA and Coop shops in
OL,15,FSweden were hit. Thirteen SuperValu
OL,16,Fshops have also been impacted in
OL,17,FIreland.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
